body:
Since InstantSearch.js 3, you can use the [`panel`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/panel/js/) widget like this:

```js
const brandMenuSelect = instantsearch.widgets.panel({
  hidden: ({ results }) => results.getFacetValues('brand').data.length <= 1,
})(instantsearch.widgets.menuSelect);

search.addWidget(
  brandMenuSelect({
    container: '#brand-list',
    attribute: 'brand',
  })
);
```
